INSERT INTO questions(id,data) VALUES
('10g3-w10-p578-q56',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p578-q56","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Simplify expressions using the multiplication properties of exponents","type":"FRQ","marks":2,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Consider $(m^p)(m^q)$ and $(m^p)^q$. (a) State the assumption $m>0$, $m\\ne1$, and suppose p and q are positive integers. Find the condition on p and q for equality and give an example. Explain separately what happens when $m=1$. (b) If m, p and q are positive integers, can $(m^p)(m^q)>(m^p)^q$ ever be true? Give a counterexample or explain.","promptAr":"قارن بين $(m^p)(m^q)$ و$(m^p)^q$. (أ) افترض $m>0$ و$m\\ne1$ وأن p وq عددان صحيحان موجبان. أوجد شرط التساوي وأعط مثالاً. وضح على حدة حالة $m=1$. (ب) إذا كانت m وp وq أعداداً صحيحة موجبة، فهل يمكن أن يكون $(m^p)(m^q)>(m^p)^q$؟ أعط مثالاً أو فسّر.","answer":"(a) For $m>0$, $m\\ne1$, $m^{p+q}=m^{pq}$ iff $p+q=pq$, equivalently $(p-1)(q-1)=1$. For positive integer p,q this forces $p=q=2$; for example $m=2$ gives $2^2\\cdot2^2=(2^2)^2=16$. When $m=1$, equality holds for every positive p,q. (b) Yes: choose $m=2,p=q=1$. Then $2^1\\cdot2^1=4>2=(2^1)^1$.","answerAr":"(أ) مع $m>0$ و$m\\ne1$ يلزم $p+q=pq$، أي $(p-1)(q-1)=1$. وللأعداد الصحيحة الموجبة نحصل على $p=q=2$؛ مثلاً عند $m=2$ يكون الطرفان 16. أما عند $m=1$ فيتساوى الطرفان لكل p وq موجبين. (ب) نعم؛ باختيار $m=2,p=q=1$ نحصل على $4>2$.","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourcePage":578,"sourceQuestion":56,"exponentReasoning":"equality-assumptions","responseParts":[{"label":"(a) Assumptions, condition and example · الافتراضات والشرط والمثال"},{"label":"(b) Inequality example and explanation · مثال المتباينة وتفسيره"}]}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p578-q57',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p578-q57","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Simplify expressions using the multiplication properties of exponents","type":"FRQ","marks":2,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"For nonzero real numbers a and b and integers m and t, simplify $\\left(\\frac{-a^m}{b^t}\\right)^{2t}$. Explain the sign and every exponent rule used.","promptAr":"للعددين الحقيقيين غير الصفريين a وb والعددين الصحيحين m وt، بسّط $\\left(\\frac{-a^m}{b^t}\\right)^{2t}$. فسّر الإشارة وكل خاصية أسس استعملتها.","answer":"$\\left(\\frac{-a^m}{b^t}\\right)^{2t}=\\frac{(-1)^{2t}(a^m)^{2t}}{(b^t)^{2t}}=\\frac{a^{2mt}}{b^{2t^2}}$. The exponent $2t$ is even (including negative even integers and zero), so $(-1)^{2t}=1$. Nonzero a,b make negative and zero powers well defined. At $t=0$ the result is 1.","answerAr":"نوزّع القوة على البسط والمقام: $\\frac{(-1)^{2t}(a^m)^{2t}}{(b^t)^{2t}}=\\frac{a^{2mt}}{b^{2t^2}}$. العدد $2t$ زوجي حتى عندما يكون سالباً أو صفراً، لذا $(-1)^{2t}=1$. اشتراط عدم انعدام a وb يضمن تعريف الأسس السالبة والصفرية. عند $t=0$ تكون النتيجة 1.","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourcePage":578,"sourceQuestion":57,"exponentReasoning":"symbolic-quotient","responseParts":[{"label":"Simplified expression · العبارة المبسطة"},{"label":"Explain sign and exponent laws · تفسير الإشارة وخصائص الأسس"}]}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p578-q58',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p578-q58","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Simplify expressions using the multiplication properties of exponents","type":"FRQ","marks":3,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"For $y=x$, $y=x^2$ and $y=x^3$: (a) complete the related-expression and power columns; (b) graph all three using a graphing calculator and sketch them on the empty plane; (c) classify each as linear or nonlinear; (d) explain how the power of x lets you classify these equations without graphing.","promptAr":"للمعادلات $y=x$ و$y=x^2$ و$y=x^3$: (أ) أكمل عمودي العبارة المرتبطة وأس x؛ (ب) استعمل الحاسبة البيانية وارسم الدوال على المستوى الفارغ؛ (ج) صنّف كل معادلة إلى خطية أو غير خطية؛ (د) فسّر كيف يحدد أس x التصنيف هنا دون رسم.","answer":"The related expressions are $x,x^2,x^3$, with powers 1,2,3. Only $y=x$ is linear; its graph is a straight line through the origin. $y=x^2$ is an upward parabola, and $y=x^3$ is a cubic curve. For these nonconstant single-variable monomials, power 1 is linear; powers 2 and 3 are nonlinear. Sample points at x=−2,−1,0,1,2: y=x gives −2,−1,0,1,2; y=x² gives 4,1,0,1,4; y=x³ gives −8,−1,0,1,8.","answerAr":"العبارات المرتبطة هي $x,x^2,x^3$ وأسُسها 1 و2 و3. المعادلة $y=x$ فقط خطية ورسمها مستقيم يمر بالأصل. أما $y=x^2$ فقطع مكافئ مفتوح للأعلى و$y=x^3$ منحنى تكعيبي؛ وهما غير خطيتين. لهذه الوحيدات غير الثابتة، الأس 1 يعطي معادلة خطية، والأسّان 2 و3 يعطيان معادلتين غير خطيتين.","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourcePage":578,"sourceQuestion":58,"exponentAnalysis":{"powers":[1,2,3]},"responseParts":[{"label":"Complete table · إكمال الجدول"},{"label":"Graphs and classification · الرسوم والتصنيف"},{"label":"Explain classification · تفسير التصنيف"}]}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-supplied-q25',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-supplied-q25","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Simplify expressions using the multiplication properties of exponents","type":"FRQ","marks":2,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"A square field has side length $5x^3y^5$. Find its area in terms of x and y. Show the exponent rules and your working.","promptAr":"حقل مربع طول ضلعه $5x^3y^5$. أوجد مساحته بدلالة x وy. وضّح خصائص الأسس وخطوات الحل.","answer":"The simplified area is $25x^{6}y^{10}$. Apply powers to every factor, multiply nested exponents, and add exponents only for matching bases.","answerAr":"الناتج المبسط هو $25x^{6}y^{10}$. نوزّع القوة على كل عامل، ونضرب الأسس في قوة القوة، ونجمع الأسس عند ضرب الأساس نفسه.","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourceQuestion":25,"sourceReference":"Supplied application/mixed-exercise image; page unspecified. Aligned with multiplication properties of exponents.","exponentModel":{"numerator":[{"coefficient":5,"powers":{"x":3,"y":5},"power":2}],"denominator":[],"outerPower":1},"exponentModelDiagram":{"kind":"square","edgeLatex":"5x^3y^5"},"responseParts":[{"label":"Working and exponent laws · خطوات الحل وخصائص الأسس"},{"label":"Final expression · العبارة النهائية"}]}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-supplied-q26',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-supplied-q26","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Simplify expressions using the multiplication properties of exponents","type":"FRQ","marks":2,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"The square interior of a picture frame has side length $5c^3d^2$. Find the area of the interior in terms of c and d. Show the exponent rules and your working.","promptAr":"الجزء الداخلي لإطار صورة مربع طول ضلعه $5c^3d^2$. أوجد مساحته بدلالة c وd. وضّح خصائص الأسس وخطوات الحل.","answer":"The simplified area is $25c^{6}d^{4}$. Apply powers to every factor, multiply nested exponents, and add exponents only for matching bases.","answerAr":"الناتج المبسط هو $25c^{6}d^{4}$. نوزّع القوة على كل عامل، ونضرب الأسس في قوة القوة، ونجمع الأسس عند ضرب الأساس نفسه.","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourceQuestion":26,"sourceReference":"Supplied application/mixed-exercise image; page unspecified. Aligned with multiplication properties of exponents.","exponentModel":{"numerator":[{"coefficient":5,"powers":{"c":3,"d":2},"power":2}],"denominator":[],"outerPower":1},"exponentModelDiagram":{"kind":"square","edgeLatex":"5c^3d^2"},"responseParts":[{"label":"Working and exponent laws · خطوات الحل وخصائص الأسس"},{"label":"Final expression · العبارة النهائية"}]}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-supplied-q27',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-supplied-q27","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Simplify expressions using the multiplication properties of exponents","type":"FRQ","marks":2,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"A shipping box is a cube with edge length $4m^8n^4$. Find its volume in terms of m and n. Show the exponent rules and your working.","promptAr":"صندوق شحن مكعب طول حرفه $4m^8n^4$. أوجد حجمه بدلالة m وn. وضّح خصائص الأسس وخطوات الحل.","answer":"The simplified volume is $64m^{24}n^{12}$. Apply powers to every factor, multiply nested exponents, and add exponents only for matching bases.","answerAr":"الناتج المبسط هو $64m^{24}n^{12}$. نوزّع القوة على كل عامل، ونضرب الأسس في قوة القوة، ونجمع الأسس عند ضرب الأساس نفسه.","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourceQuestion":27,"sourceReference":"Supplied application/mixed-exercise image; page unspecified. Aligned with multiplication properties of exponents.","exponentModel":{"numerator":[{"coefficient":4,"powers":{"m":8,"n":4},"power":3}],"denominator":[],"outerPower":1},"exponentModelDiagram":{"kind":"cube","edgeLatex":"4m^8n^4"},"responseParts":[{"label":"Working and exponent laws · خطوات الحل وخصائص الأسس"},{"label":"Final expression · العبارة النهائية"}]}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-supplied-q28',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-supplied-q28","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Simplify expressions using the multiplication properties of exponents","type":"FRQ","marks":2,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Simplify $(2a^3)^4(a^3)^3$. Show the exponent rules and your working.","promptAr":"بسّط $(2a^3)^4(a^3)^3$. وضّح خصائص الأسس وخطوات الحل.","answer":"The simplified expression is $16a^{21}$. Apply powers to every factor, multiply nested exponents, and add exponents only for matching bases.","answerAr":"الناتج المبسط هو $16a^{21}$. نوزّع القوة على كل عامل، ونضرب الأسس في قوة القوة، ونجمع الأسس عند ضرب الأساس نفسه.","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourceQuestion":28,"sourceReference":"Supplied application/mixed-exercise image; page unspecified. Aligned with multiplication properties of exponents.","exponentModel":{"numerator":[{"coefficient":2,"powers":{"a":3},"power":4},{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"a":3},"power":3}],"denominator":[],"outerPower":1},"responseParts":[{"label":"Working and exponent laws · خطوات الحل وخصائص الأسس"},{"label":"Final expression · العبارة النهائية"}]}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-supplied-q29',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-supplied-q29","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Simplify expressions using the multiplication properties of exponents","type":"FRQ","marks":2,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Simplify $(c^3)^2(-3c^5)^2$. Show the exponent rules and your working.","promptAr":"بسّط $(c^3)^2(-3c^5)^2$. وضّح خصائص الأسس وخطوات الحل.","answer":"The simplified expression is $9c^{16}$. Apply powers to every factor, multiply nested exponents, and add exponents only for matching bases.","answerAr":"الناتج المبسط هو $9c^{16}$. نوزّع القوة على كل عامل، ونضرب الأسس في قوة القوة، ونجمع الأسس عند ضرب الأساس نفسه.","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourceQuestion":29,"sourceReference":"Supplied application/mixed-exercise image; page unspecified. Aligned with multiplication properties of exponents.","exponentModel":{"numerator":[{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"c":3},"power":2},{"coefficient":-3,"powers":{"c":5},"power":2}],"denominator":[],"outerPower":1},"responseParts":[{"label":"Working and exponent laws · خطوات الحل وخصائص الأسس"},{"label":"Final expression · العبارة النهائية"}]}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-supplied-q30',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-supplied-q30","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Simplify expressions using the multiplication properties of exponents","type":"FRQ","marks":2,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Simplify $(2gh^4)^3[(-2g^4h)^3]^2$. Show the exponent rules and your working.","promptAr":"بسّط $(2gh^4)^3[(-2g^4h)^3]^2$. وضّح خصائص الأسس وخطوات الحل.","answer":"The simplified expression is $512g^{27}h^{18}$. Apply powers to every factor, multiply nested exponents, and add exponents only for matching bases.","answerAr":"الناتج المبسط هو $512g^{27}h^{18}$. نوزّع القوة على كل عامل، ونضرب الأسس في قوة القوة، ونجمع الأسس عند ضرب الأساس نفسه.","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourceQuestion":30,"sourceReference":"Supplied application/mixed-exercise image; page unspecified. Aligned with multiplication properties of exponents.","exponentModel":{"numerator":[{"coefficient":2,"powers":{"g":1,"h":4},"power":3},{"coefficient":-2,"powers":{"g":4,"h":1},"power":6}],"denominator":[],"outerPower":1},"responseParts":[{"label":"Working and exponent laws · خطوات الحل وخصائص الأسس"},{"label":"Final expression · العبارة النهائية"}]}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-supplied-q31',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-supplied-q31","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Simplify expressions using the multiplication properties of exponents","type":"FRQ","marks":2,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Simplify $(5k^2m)^3[(4km^4)^2]^2$. Show the exponent rules and your working.","promptAr":"بسّط $(5k^2m)^3[(4km^4)^2]^2$. وضّح خصائص الأسس وخطوات الحل.","answer":"The simplified expression is $32000k^{10}m^{19}$. Apply powers to every factor, multiply nested exponents, and add exponents only for matching bases.","answerAr":"الناتج المبسط هو $32000k^{10}m^{19}$. نوزّع القوة على كل عامل، ونضرب الأسس في قوة القوة، ونجمع الأسس عند ضرب الأساس نفسه.","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourceQuestion":31,"sourceReference":"Supplied application/mixed-exercise image; page unspecified. Aligned with multiplication properties of exponents.","exponentModel":{"numerator":[{"coefficient":5,"powers":{"k":2,"m":1},"power":3},{"coefficient":4,"powers":{"k":1,"m":4},"power":4}],"denominator":[],"outerPower":1},"responseParts":[{"label":"Working and exponent laws · خطوات الحل وخصائص الأسس"},{"label":"Final expression · العبارة النهائية"}]}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p583-q3',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p583-q3","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Divide monomials using the properties of exponents","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Simplify $\\frac{c^4d^4f^3}{c^2d^4f^3}$. Assume all variables are nonzero; use positive exponents in the final answer.","promptAr":"بسّط $\\frac{c^4d^4f^3}{c^2d^4f^3}$. افترض أن جميع المتغيرات غير صفرية، واكتب الإجابة النهائية بأسس موجبة.","answer":"$\\frac{c^4d^4f^3}{c^2d^4f^3}=c^{2}$. Use the power of a product/quotient and add or subtract exponents of like bases.","answerAr":"$\\frac{c^4d^4f^3}{c^2d^4f^3}=c^{2}$. نستعمل خاصية قوة حاصل الضرب أو خارج القسمة، ونجمع أو نطرح أسس الأساس نفسه.","options":["$c^{2}df$","$c^{2}d^{8}f^{6}$","$c^{2}$","$c^{6}$"],"optionsAr":["$c^{2}df$","$c^{2}d^{8}f^{6}$","$c^{2}$","$c^{6}$"],"sourcePage":583,"sourceQuestion":3,"exponentModel":{"numerator":[{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"c":4,"d":4,"f":3},"power":1}],"denominator":[{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"c":2,"d":4,"f":3},"power":1}],"outerPower":1},"monomialChoices":[{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"c":2,"d":1,"f":1}},{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"c":2,"d":8,"f":6}},{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"c":2}},{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"c":6}}],"correctIndex":2}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p583-q5',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p583-q5","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Divide monomials using the properties of exponents","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Simplify $\\left(\\frac{p^2t^7}{10}\\right)^3$. Assume all variables are nonzero; use positive exponents in the final answer.","promptAr":"بسّط $\\left(\\frac{p^2t^7}{10}\\right)^3$. افترض أن جميع المتغيرات غير صفرية، واكتب الإجابة النهائية بأسس موجبة.","answer":"$\\left(\\frac{p^2t^7}{10}\\right)^3=\\frac{p^{6}t^{21}}{1000}$. Use the power of a product/quotient and add or subtract exponents of like bases.","answerAr":"$\\left(\\frac{p^2t^7}{10}\\right)^3=\\frac{p^{6}t^{21}}{1000}$. نستعمل خاصية قوة حاصل الضرب أو خارج القسمة، ونجمع أو نطرح أسس الأساس نفسه.","options":["$\\frac{p^{6}t^{21}}{30}$","$\\frac{p^{5}t^{10}}{1000}$","$\\frac{p^{6}t^{21}}{10}$","$\\frac{p^{6}t^{21}}{1000}$"],"optionsAr":["$\\frac{p^{6}t^{21}}{30}$","$\\frac{p^{5}t^{10}}{1000}$","$\\frac{p^{6}t^{21}}{10}$","$\\frac{p^{6}t^{21}}{1000}$"],"sourcePage":583,"sourceQuestion":5,"exponentModel":{"numerator":[{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"p":2,"t":7},"power":1}],"denominator":[{"coefficient":10,"powers":{},"power":1}],"outerPower":3},"monomialChoices":[{"coefficient":0.03333333333333333,"powers":{"p":6,"t":21}},{"coefficient":0.001,"powers":{"p":5,"t":10}},{"coefficient":0.1,"powers":{"p":6,"t":21}},{"coefficient":0.0010000000000000002,"powers":{"p":6,"t":21}}],"correctIndex":3}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p583-q6',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p583-q6","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Divide monomials using the properties of exponents","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Simplify $\\frac{a^7b^8c^8}{a^5bc^7}$. Assume all variables are nonzero; use positive exponents in the final answer.","promptAr":"بسّط $\\frac{a^7b^8c^8}{a^5bc^7}$. افترض أن جميع المتغيرات غير صفرية، واكتب الإجابة النهائية بأسس موجبة.","answer":"$\\frac{a^7b^8c^8}{a^5bc^7}=a^{2}b^{7}c$. Use the power of a product/quotient and add or subtract exponents of like bases.","answerAr":"$\\frac{a^7b^8c^8}{a^5bc^7}=a^{2}b^{7}c$. نستعمل خاصية قوة حاصل الضرب أو خارج القسمة، ونجمع أو نطرح أسس الأساس نفسه.","options":["$a^{2}b^{7}c$","$a^{12}b^{9}c^{15}$","$a^{2}b^{8}c$","$a^{2}b^{7}c^{15}$"],"optionsAr":["$a^{2}b^{7}c$","$a^{12}b^{9}c^{15}$","$a^{2}b^{8}c$","$a^{2}b^{7}c^{15}$"],"sourcePage":583,"sourceQuestion":6,"exponentModel":{"numerator":[{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"a":7,"b":8,"c":8},"power":1}],"denominator":[{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"a":5,"b":1,"c":7},"power":1}],"outerPower":1},"monomialChoices":[{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"a":2,"b":7,"c":1}},{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"a":12,"b":9,"c":15}},{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"a":2,"b":8,"c":1}},{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"a":2,"b":7,"c":15}}],"correctIndex":0}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p583-q7',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p583-q7","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Divide monomials using the properties of exponents","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Simplify $\\left(\\frac{3np^3}{7q^2}\\right)^2$. Assume all variables are nonzero; use positive exponents in the final answer.","promptAr":"بسّط $\\left(\\frac{3np^3}{7q^2}\\right)^2$. افترض أن جميع المتغيرات غير صفرية، واكتب الإجابة النهائية بأسس موجبة.","answer":"$\\left(\\frac{3np^3}{7q^2}\\right)^2=\\frac{9n^{2}p^{6}}{49q^{4}}$. Use the power of a product/quotient and add or subtract exponents of like bases.","answerAr":"$\\left(\\frac{3np^3}{7q^2}\\right)^2=\\frac{9n^{2}p^{6}}{49q^{4}}$. نستعمل خاصية قوة حاصل الضرب أو خارج القسمة، ونجمع أو نطرح أسس الأساس نفسه.","options":["$\\frac{9n^{2}p^{6}}{7q^{4}}$","$\\frac{9n^{2}p^{6}}{49q^{4}}$","$\\frac{3n^{2}p^{6}}{7q^{4}}$","$\\frac{9np^{3}}{49q^{2}}$"],"optionsAr":["$\\frac{9n^{2}p^{6}}{7q^{4}}$","$\\frac{9n^{2}p^{6}}{49q^{4}}$","$\\frac{3n^{2}p^{6}}{7q^{4}}$","$\\frac{9np^{3}}{49q^{2}}$"],"sourcePage":583,"sourceQuestion":7,"exponentModel":{"numerator":[{"coefficient":3,"powers":{"n":1,"p":3},"power":1}],"denominator":[{"coefficient":7,"powers":{"q":2},"power":1}],"outerPower":2},"monomialChoices":[{"coefficient":1.2857142857142858,"powers":{"n":2,"p":6,"q":-4}},{"coefficient":0.18367346938775508,"powers":{"n":2,"p":6,"q":-4}},{"coefficient":0.42857142857142855,"powers":{"n":2,"p":6,"q":-4}},{"coefficient":0.1836734693877551,"powers":{"n":1,"p":3,"q":-2}}],"correctIndex":1}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p583-q8',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p583-q8","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Divide monomials using the properties of exponents","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Simplify $\\left(\\frac{2r^3t^6}{5w^9}\\right)^4$. Assume all variables are nonzero; use positive exponents in the final answer.","promptAr":"بسّط $\\left(\\frac{2r^3t^6}{5w^9}\\right)^4$. افترض أن جميع المتغيرات غير صفرية، واكتب الإجابة النهائية بأسس موجبة.","answer":"$\\left(\\frac{2r^3t^6}{5w^9}\\right)^4=\\frac{16r^{12}t^{24}}{625w^{36}}$. Use the power of a product/quotient and add or subtract exponents of like bases.","answerAr":"$\\left(\\frac{2r^3t^6}{5w^9}\\right)^4=\\frac{16r^{12}t^{24}}{625w^{36}}$. نستعمل خاصية قوة حاصل الضرب أو خارج القسمة، ونجمع أو نطرح أسس الأساس نفسه.","options":["$\\frac{16r^{7}t^{10}}{625w^{13}}$","$\\frac{16r^{12}t^{24}}{5w^{36}}$","$\\frac{16r^{12}t^{24}}{625w^{36}}$","$\\frac{2r^{12}t^{24}}{5w^{36}}$"],"optionsAr":["$\\frac{16r^{7}t^{10}}{625w^{13}}$","$\\frac{16r^{12}t^{24}}{5w^{36}}$","$\\frac{16r^{12}t^{24}}{625w^{36}}$","$\\frac{2r^{12}t^{24}}{5w^{36}}$"],"sourcePage":583,"sourceQuestion":8,"exponentModel":{"numerator":[{"coefficient":2,"powers":{"r":3,"t":6},"power":1}],"denominator":[{"coefficient":5,"powers":{"w":9},"power":1}],"outerPower":4},"monomialChoices":[{"coefficient":0.0256,"powers":{"r":7,"t":10,"w":-13}},{"coefficient":3.2,"powers":{"r":12,"t":24,"w":-36}},{"coefficient":0.025600000000000005,"powers":{"r":12,"t":24,"w":-36}},{"coefficient":0.4,"powers":{"r":12,"t":24,"w":-36}}],"correctIndex":2}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p583-q9',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p583-q9","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Divide monomials using the properties of exponents","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Simplify $\\left(\\frac{3m^5p^3}{4p^8}\\right)^4$. Assume all variables are nonzero; use positive exponents in the final answer.","promptAr":"بسّط $\\left(\\frac{3m^5p^3}{4p^8}\\right)^4$. افترض أن جميع المتغيرات غير صفرية، واكتب الإجابة النهائية بأسس موجبة.","answer":"$\\left(\\frac{3m^5p^3}{4p^8}\\right)^4=\\frac{81m^{20}}{256p^{20}}$. Use the power of a product/quotient and add or subtract exponents of like bases.","answerAr":"$\\left(\\frac{3m^5p^3}{4p^8}\\right)^4=\\frac{81m^{20}}{256p^{20}}$. نستعمل خاصية قوة حاصل الضرب أو خارج القسمة، ونجمع أو نطرح أسس الأساس نفسه.","options":["$\\frac{81m^{20}p^{20}}{256}$","$\\frac{81m^{9}}{256p^{9}}$","$\\frac{3m^{20}}{4p^{20}}$","$\\frac{81m^{20}}{256p^{20}}$"],"optionsAr":["$\\frac{81m^{20}p^{20}}{256}$","$\\frac{81m^{9}}{256p^{9}}$","$\\frac{3m^{20}}{4p^{20}}$","$\\frac{81m^{20}}{256p^{20}}$"],"sourcePage":583,"sourceQuestion":9,"exponentModel":{"numerator":[{"coefficient":3,"powers":{"m":5,"p":3},"power":1}],"denominator":[{"coefficient":4,"powers":{"p":8},"power":1}],"outerPower":4},"monomialChoices":[{"coefficient":0.31640625,"powers":{"m":20,"p":20}},{"coefficient":0.31640625,"powers":{"m":9,"p":-9}},{"coefficient":0.75,"powers":{"m":20,"p":-20}},{"coefficient":0.31640625,"powers":{"m":20,"p":-20}}],"correctIndex":3}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p581-learn-1',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p581-learn-1","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Divide monomials using the properties of exponents","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Simplify $\\left(\\frac25\\right)^3$. Assume all variables are nonzero; use positive exponents in the final answer.","promptAr":"بسّط $\\left(\\frac25\\right)^3$. افترض أن جميع المتغيرات غير صفرية، واكتب الإجابة النهائية بأسس موجبة.","answer":"$\\left(\\frac25\\right)^3=\\frac{8}{125}$. Use the power of a product/quotient and add or subtract exponents of like bases.","answerAr":"$\\left(\\frac25\\right)^3=\\frac{8}{125}$. نستعمل خاصية قوة حاصل الضرب أو خارج القسمة، ونجمع أو نطرح أسس الأساس نفسه.","options":["$\\frac{8}{125}$","$\\frac{2}{5}$","$\\frac{8}{15}$","$\\frac{6}{125}$"],"optionsAr":["$\\frac{8}{125}$","$\\frac{2}{5}$","$\\frac{8}{15}$","$\\frac{6}{125}$"],"sourcePage":581,"sourceQuestion":1,"sourcePart":"Learn","exponentModel":{"numerator":[{"coefficient":2,"powers":{},"power":1}],"denominator":[{"coefficient":5,"powers":{},"power":1}],"outerPower":3},"monomialChoices":[{"coefficient":0.06400000000000002,"powers":{}},{"coefficient":0.4,"powers":{}},{"coefficient":0.5333333333333333,"powers":{}},{"coefficient":0.048,"powers":{}}],"correctIndex":0}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p581-learn-2',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p581-learn-2","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Divide monomials using the properties of exponents","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Simplify $\\left(\\frac pq\\right)^2$. Assume all variables are nonzero; use positive exponents in the final answer.","promptAr":"بسّط $\\left(\\frac pq\\right)^2$. افترض أن جميع المتغيرات غير صفرية، واكتب الإجابة النهائية بأسس موجبة.","answer":"$\\left(\\frac pq\\right)^2=\\frac{p^{2}}{q^{2}}$. Use the power of a product/quotient and add or subtract exponents of like bases.","answerAr":"$\\left(\\frac pq\\right)^2=\\frac{p^{2}}{q^{2}}$. نستعمل خاصية قوة حاصل الضرب أو خارج القسمة، ونجمع أو نطرح أسس الأساس نفسه.","options":["$\\frac{2p}{q}$","$\\frac{p^{2}}{q^{2}}$","$\\frac{p^{2}}{q}$","$\\frac{p}{q^{2}}$"],"optionsAr":["$\\frac{2p}{q}$","$\\frac{p^{2}}{q^{2}}$","$\\frac{p^{2}}{q}$","$\\frac{p}{q^{2}}$"],"sourcePage":581,"sourceQuestion":2,"sourcePart":"Learn","exponentModel":{"numerator":[{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"p":1},"power":1}],"denominator":[{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"q":1},"power":1}],"outerPower":2},"monomialChoices":[{"coefficient":2,"powers":{"p":1,"q":-1}},{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"p":2,"q":-2}},{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"p":2,"q":-1}},{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"p":1,"q":-2}}],"correctIndex":1}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p581-learn-3',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p581-learn-3","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Divide monomials using the properties of exponents","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Simplify $\\left(\\frac cd\\right)^6$. Assume all variables are nonzero; use positive exponents in the final answer.","promptAr":"بسّط $\\left(\\frac cd\\right)^6$. افترض أن جميع المتغيرات غير صفرية، واكتب الإجابة النهائية بأسس موجبة.","answer":"$\\left(\\frac cd\\right)^6=\\frac{c^{6}}{d^{6}}$. Use the power of a product/quotient and add or subtract exponents of like bases.","answerAr":"$\\left(\\frac cd\\right)^6=\\frac{c^{6}}{d^{6}}$. نستعمل خاصية قوة حاصل الضرب أو خارج القسمة، ونجمع أو نطرح أسس الأساس نفسه.","options":["$\\frac{c}{d^{6}}$","$\\frac{6c}{d}$","$\\frac{c^{6}}{d^{6}}$","$\\frac{c^{6}}{d}$"],"optionsAr":["$\\frac{c}{d^{6}}$","$\\frac{6c}{d}$","$\\frac{c^{6}}{d^{6}}$","$\\frac{c^{6}}{d}$"],"sourcePage":581,"sourceQuestion":3,"sourcePart":"Learn","exponentModel":{"numerator":[{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"c":1},"power":1}],"denominator":[{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"d":1},"power":1}],"outerPower":6},"monomialChoices":[{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"c":1,"d":-6}},{"coefficient":6,"powers":{"c":1,"d":-1}},{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"c":6,"d":-6}},{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"c":6,"d":-1}}],"correctIndex":2}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p591-q11',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p591-q11","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Simplify expressions containing negative and zero exponents","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Simplify $\\frac{3m^{-3}r^4p^2}{12t^4}$. Assume all variables are nonzero; use positive exponents in the final answer.","promptAr":"بسّط $\\frac{3m^{-3}r^4p^2}{12t^4}$. افترض أن جميع المتغيرات غير صفرية، واكتب الإجابة النهائية بأسس موجبة.","answer":"$\\frac{3m^{-3}r^4p^2}{12t^4}=\\frac{p^{2}r^{4}}{4m^{3}t^{4}}$. Use the power of a product/quotient and add or subtract exponents of like bases.","answerAr":"$\\frac{3m^{-3}r^4p^2}{12t^4}=\\frac{p^{2}r^{4}}{4m^{3}t^{4}}$. نستعمل خاصية قوة حاصل الضرب أو خارج القسمة، ونجمع أو نطرح أسس الأساس نفسه.","options":["$\\frac{m^{3}p^{2}r^{4}}{4t^{4}}$","$\\frac{p^{2}r^{4}t^{4}}{4m^{3}}$","$\\frac{4p^{2}r^{4}}{m^{3}t^{4}}$","$\\frac{p^{2}r^{4}}{4m^{3}t^{4}}$"],"optionsAr":["$\\frac{m^{3}p^{2}r^{4}}{4t^{4}}$","$\\frac{p^{2}r^{4}t^{4}}{4m^{3}}$","$\\frac{4p^{2}r^{4}}{m^{3}t^{4}}$","$\\frac{p^{2}r^{4}}{4m^{3}t^{4}}$"],"sourcePage":591,"sourceQuestion":11,"exponentModel":{"numerator":[{"coefficient":3,"powers":{"m":-3,"r":4,"p":2},"power":1}],"denominator":[{"coefficient":12,"powers":{"t":4},"power":1}],"outerPower":1},"monomialChoices":[{"coefficient":0.25,"powers":{"m":3,"r":4,"p":2,"t":-4}},{"coefficient":0.25,"powers":{"m":-3,"r":4,"p":2,"t":4}},{"coefficient":4,"powers":{"m":-3,"r":4,"p":2,"t":-4}},{"coefficient":0.25,"powers":{"m":-3,"r":4,"p":2,"t":-4}}],"correctIndex":3}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p591-q12',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p591-q12","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Simplify expressions containing negative and zero exponents","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Simplify $\\left(\\frac{3t^6u^2v^5}{9tuv^{21}}\\right)^0$. Assume all variables are nonzero; use positive exponents in the final answer.","promptAr":"بسّط $\\left(\\frac{3t^6u^2v^5}{9tuv^{21}}\\right)^0$. افترض أن جميع المتغيرات غير صفرية، واكتب الإجابة النهائية بأسس موجبة.","answer":"$\\left(\\frac{3t^6u^2v^5}{9tuv^{21}}\\right)^0=1$. Any nonzero base to the zero power equals 1.","answerAr":"$\\left(\\frac{3t^6u^2v^5}{9tuv^{21}}\\right)^0=1$. نستعمل خاصية قوة حاصل الضرب أو خارج القسمة، ونجمع أو نطرح أسس الأساس نفسه.","options":["$1$","$0$","$\\frac{t^{5}u}{3v^{16}}$","$-1$"],"optionsAr":["$1$","$0$","$\\frac{t^{5}u}{3v^{16}}$","$-1$"],"sourcePage":591,"sourceQuestion":12,"exponentModel":{"numerator":[{"coefficient":3,"powers":{"t":6,"u":2,"v":5},"power":1}],"denominator":[{"coefficient":9,"powers":{"t":1,"u":1,"v":21},"power":1}],"outerPower":0},"monomialChoices":[{"coefficient":1,"powers":{}},{"coefficient":0,"powers":{}},{"coefficient":0.3333333333333333,"powers":{"t":5,"u":1,"v":-16}},{"coefficient":-1,"powers":{}}],"correctIndex":0}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p591-q13',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p591-q13","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Simplify expressions containing negative and zero exponents","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Simplify $\\frac{x^{-4}y^9}{z^{-2}}$. Assume all variables are nonzero; use positive exponents in the final answer.","promptAr":"بسّط $\\frac{x^{-4}y^9}{z^{-2}}$. افترض أن جميع المتغيرات غير صفرية، واكتب الإجابة النهائية بأسس موجبة.","answer":"$\\frac{x^{-4}y^9}{z^{-2}}=\\frac{y^{9}z^{2}}{x^{4}}$. Use the power of a product/quotient and add or subtract exponents of like bases.","answerAr":"$\\frac{x^{-4}y^9}{z^{-2}}=\\frac{y^{9}z^{2}}{x^{4}}$. نستعمل خاصية قوة حاصل الضرب أو خارج القسمة، ونجمع أو نطرح أسس الأساس نفسه.","options":["$-x^{4}y^{9}z^{2}$","$\\frac{y^{9}z^{2}}{x^{4}}$","$\\frac{x^{4}y^{9}}{z^{2}}$","$\\frac{y^{9}}{x^{4}z^{2}}$"],"optionsAr":["$-x^{4}y^{9}z^{2}$","$\\frac{y^{9}z^{2}}{x^{4}}$","$\\frac{x^{4}y^{9}}{z^{2}}$","$\\frac{y^{9}}{x^{4}z^{2}}$"],"sourcePage":591,"sourceQuestion":13,"exponentModel":{"numerator":[{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"x":-4,"y":9},"power":1}],"denominator":[{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"z":-2},"power":1}],"outerPower":1},"monomialChoices":[{"coefficient":-1,"powers":{"x":4,"y":9,"z":2}},{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"x":-4,"y":9,"z":2}},{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"x":4,"y":9,"z":-2}},{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"x":-4,"y":9,"z":-2}}],"correctIndex":1}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p591-q14',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p591-q14","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Simplify expressions containing negative and zero exponents","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Simplify $\\left(\\frac{-5f^9g^4h^2}{fg^2h^3}\\right)^0$. Assume all variables are nonzero; use positive exponents in the final answer.","promptAr":"بسّط $\\left(\\frac{-5f^9g^4h^2}{fg^2h^3}\\right)^0$. افترض أن جميع المتغيرات غير صفرية، واكتب الإجابة النهائية بأسس موجبة.","answer":"$\\left(\\frac{-5f^9g^4h^2}{fg^2h^3}\\right)^0=1$. The entire nonzero negative base is raised to zero, so the result is 1.","answerAr":"$\\left(\\frac{-5f^9g^4h^2}{fg^2h^3}\\right)^0=1$. نستعمل خاصية قوة حاصل الضرب أو خارج القسمة، ونجمع أو نطرح أسس الأساس نفسه.","options":["$-1$","$-\\frac{5f^{8}g^{2}}{h}$","$1$","$0$"],"optionsAr":["$-1$","$-\\frac{5f^{8}g^{2}}{h}$","$1$","$0$"],"sourcePage":591,"sourceQuestion":14,"exponentModel":{"numerator":[{"coefficient":-5,"powers":{"f":9,"g":4,"h":2},"power":1}],"denominator":[{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"f":1,"g":2,"h":3},"power":1}],"outerPower":0},"monomialChoices":[{"coefficient":-1,"powers":{}},{"coefficient":-5,"powers":{"f":8,"g":2,"h":-1}},{"coefficient":1,"powers":{}},{"coefficient":0,"powers":{}}],"correctIndex":2}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p587-example1-a',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p587-example1-a","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Simplify expressions containing negative and zero exponents","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Simplify $\\left(\\frac{-8m^2np^8}{9k^2mn^4}\\right)^0$. Assume all variables are nonzero; use positive exponents in the final answer.","promptAr":"بسّط $\\left(\\frac{-8m^2np^8}{9k^2mn^4}\\right)^0$. افترض أن جميع المتغيرات غير صفرية، واكتب الإجابة النهائية بأسس موجبة.","answer":"$\\left(\\frac{-8m^2np^8}{9k^2mn^4}\\right)^0=1$. Use the power of a product/quotient and add or subtract exponents of like bases.","answerAr":"$\\left(\\frac{-8m^2np^8}{9k^2mn^4}\\right)^0=1$. نستعمل خاصية قوة حاصل الضرب أو خارج القسمة، ونجمع أو نطرح أسس الأساس نفسه.","options":["$0$","$-1$","$-\\frac{8mp^{8}}{9k^{2}n^{3}}$","$1$"],"optionsAr":["$0$","$-1$","$-\\frac{8mp^{8}}{9k^{2}n^{3}}$","$1$"],"sourcePage":587,"sourceQuestion":1,"sourcePart":"Example 1A","exponentModel":{"numerator":[{"coefficient":-8,"powers":{"m":2,"n":1,"p":8},"power":1}],"denominator":[{"coefficient":9,"powers":{"k":2,"m":1,"n":4},"power":1}],"outerPower":0},"monomialChoices":[{"coefficient":0,"powers":{}},{"coefficient":-1,"powers":{}},{"coefficient":-0.8888888888888888,"powers":{"m":1,"n":-3,"p":8,"k":-2}},{"coefficient":1,"powers":{}}],"correctIndex":3}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p587-example1-b',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p587-example1-b","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Simplify expressions containing negative and zero exponents","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Simplify $\\frac{a^4b^0}{a^2}$. Assume all variables are nonzero; use positive exponents in the final answer.","promptAr":"بسّط $\\frac{a^4b^0}{a^2}$. افترض أن جميع المتغيرات غير صفرية، واكتب الإجابة النهائية بأسس موجبة.","answer":"$\\frac{a^4b^0}{a^2}=a^{2}$. Use the power of a product/quotient and add or subtract exponents of like bases.","answerAr":"$\\frac{a^4b^0}{a^2}=a^{2}$. نستعمل خاصية قوة حاصل الضرب أو خارج القسمة، ونجمع أو نطرح أسس الأساس نفسه.","options":["$a^{2}$","$1$","$0$","$a^{6}$"],"optionsAr":["$a^{2}$","$1$","$0$","$a^{6}$"],"sourcePage":587,"sourceQuestion":1,"sourcePart":"Example 1B","exponentModel":{"numerator":[{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"a":4,"b":0},"power":1}],"denominator":[{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"a":2},"power":1}],"outerPower":1},"monomialChoices":[{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"a":2}},{"coefficient":1,"powers":{}},{"coefficient":0,"powers":{}},{"coefficient":1,"powers":{"a":6}}],"correctIndex":0}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p587-designed',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p587-designed","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Simplify expressions containing negative and zero exponents","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Simplify $(-7)^0$. Assume all variables are nonzero; use positive exponents in the final answer.","promptAr":"بسّط $(-7)^0$. افترض أن جميع المتغيرات غير صفرية، واكتب الإجابة النهائية بأسس موجبة.","answer":"$(-7)^0=1$. Use the power of a product/quotient and add or subtract exponents of like bases.","answerAr":"$(-7)^0=1$. نستعمل خاصية قوة حاصل الضرب أو خارج القسمة، ونجمع أو نطرح أسس الأساس نفسه.","options":["$-7$","$1$","$0$","$-1$"],"optionsAr":["$-7$","$1$","$0$","$-1$"],"sourceKind":"teacher-designed","sourceReference":"Supplementary zero-exponent practice aligned with page 587.","exponentModel":{"numerator":[{"coefficient":-7,"powers":{},"power":1}],"denominator":[],"outerPower":0},"monomialChoices":[{"coefficient":-7,"powers":{}},{"coefficient":1,"powers":{}},{"coefficient":0,"powers":{}},{"coefficient":-1,"powers":{}}],"correctIndex":1}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p599-q9',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p599-q9","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Evaluate and rewrite expressions involving rational exponents","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Evaluate $\\left(\\frac1{16}\\right)^{1/4}$. Use the principal real root.","promptAr":"أوجد قيمة $\\left(\\frac1{16}\\right)^{1/4}$ باستعمال الجذر الحقيقي الرئيس.","answer":"$\\left(\\frac1{16}\\right)^{1/4}=\\frac{1}{2}$ because $\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{4}=\\frac{1}{16}$. The base is positive, so the principal root is positive.","answerAr":"$\\left(\\frac1{16}\\right)^{1/4}=\\frac{1}{2}$ لأن $\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{4}=\\frac{1}{16}$. الأساس موجب، لذا نأخذ الجذر الرئيس الموجب.","options":["$\\frac{1}{8}$","$2$","$\\frac{1}{2}$","$\\frac{1}{4}$"],"optionsAr":["$\\frac{1}{8}$","$2$","$\\frac{1}{2}$","$\\frac{1}{4}$"],"sourcePage":599,"sourceQuestion":9,"rationalExponent":{"kind":"evaluate","base":0.0625,"p":1,"q":4,"choiceValues":[0.125,2,0.5,0.25]},"correctIndex":2}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p599-q10',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p599-q10","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Evaluate and rewrite expressions involving rational exponents","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Evaluate $\\sqrt[5]{3125}$. Use the principal real root.","promptAr":"أوجد قيمة $\\sqrt[5]{3125}$ باستعمال الجذر الحقيقي الرئيس.","answer":"$\\sqrt[5]{3125}=5$ because $\\left(5\\right)^{5}=3125$. The base is positive, so the principal root is positive.","answerAr":"$\\sqrt[5]{3125}=5$ لأن $\\left(5\\right)^{5}=3125$. الأساس موجب، لذا نأخذ الجذر الرئيس الموجب.","options":["$25$","$625$","$-5$","$5$"],"optionsAr":["$25$","$625$","$-5$","$5$"],"sourcePage":599,"sourceQuestion":10,"rationalExponent":{"kind":"evaluate","base":3125,"p":1,"q":5,"choiceValues":[25,625,-5,5]},"correctIndex":3}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p599-q11',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p599-q11","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Evaluate and rewrite expressions involving rational exponents","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Evaluate $729^{1/3}$. Use the principal real root.","promptAr":"أوجد قيمة $729^{1/3}$ باستعمال الجذر الحقيقي الرئيس.","answer":"$729^{1/3}=9$ because $\\left(9\\right)^{3}=729$. The base is positive, so the principal root is positive.","answerAr":"$729^{1/3}=9$ لأن $\\left(9\\right)^{3}=729$. الأساس موجب، لذا نأخذ الجذر الرئيس الموجب.","options":["$9$","$27$","$243$","$3$"],"optionsAr":["$9$","$27$","$243$","$3$"],"sourcePage":599,"sourceQuestion":11,"rationalExponent":{"kind":"evaluate","base":729,"p":1,"q":3,"choiceValues":[9,27,243,3]},"correctIndex":0}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p599-q12',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p599-q12","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Evaluate and rewrite expressions involving rational exponents","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Evaluate $\\left(\\frac1{32}\\right)^{1/5}$. Use the principal real root.","promptAr":"أوجد قيمة $\\left(\\frac1{32}\\right)^{1/5}$ باستعمال الجذر الحقيقي الرئيس.","answer":"$\\left(\\frac1{32}\\right)^{1/5}=\\frac{1}{2}$ because $\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{5}=\\frac{1}{32}$. The base is positive, so the principal root is positive.","answerAr":"$\\left(\\frac1{32}\\right)^{1/5}=\\frac{1}{2}$ لأن $\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{5}=\\frac{1}{32}$. الأساس موجب، لذا نأخذ الجذر الرئيس الموجب.","options":["$2$","$\\frac{1}{2}$","$\\frac{1}{5}$","$\\frac{1}{4}$"],"optionsAr":["$2$","$\\frac{1}{2}$","$\\frac{1}{5}$","$\\frac{1}{4}$"],"sourcePage":599,"sourceQuestion":12,"rationalExponent":{"kind":"evaluate","base":0.03125,"p":1,"q":5,"choiceValues":[2,0.5,0.2,0.25]},"correctIndex":1}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p599-q13',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p599-q13","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Evaluate and rewrite expressions involving rational exponents","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Evaluate $\\sqrt[6]{4096}$. Use the principal real root.","promptAr":"أوجد قيمة $\\sqrt[6]{4096}$ باستعمال الجذر الحقيقي الرئيس.","answer":"$\\sqrt[6]{4096}=4$ because $\\left(4\\right)^{6}=4096$. The base is positive, so the principal root is positive.","answerAr":"$\\sqrt[6]{4096}=4$ لأن $\\left(4\\right)^{6}=4096$. الأساس موجب، لذا نأخذ الجذر الرئيس الموجب.","options":["$8$","$16$","$4$","$-4$"],"optionsAr":["$8$","$16$","$4$","$-4$"],"sourcePage":599,"sourceQuestion":13,"rationalExponent":{"kind":"evaluate","base":4096,"p":1,"q":6,"choiceValues":[8,16,4,-4]},"correctIndex":2}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p599-q14',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p599-q14","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Evaluate and rewrite expressions involving rational exponents","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Evaluate $1024^{1/5}$. Use the principal real root.","promptAr":"أوجد قيمة $1024^{1/5}$ باستعمال الجذر الحقيقي الرئيس.","answer":"$1024^{1/5}=4$ because $\\left(4\\right)^{5}=1024$. The base is positive, so the principal root is positive.","answerAr":"$1024^{1/5}=4$ لأن $\\left(4\\right)^{5}=1024$. الأساس موجب، لذا نأخذ الجذر الرئيس الموجب.","options":["$2$","$5$","$32$","$4$"],"optionsAr":["$2$","$5$","$32$","$4$"],"sourcePage":599,"sourceQuestion":14,"rationalExponent":{"kind":"evaluate","base":1024,"p":1,"q":5,"choiceValues":[2,5,32,4]},"correctIndex":3}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p599-q15',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p599-q15","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Evaluate and rewrite expressions involving rational exponents","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Evaluate $\\left(\\frac{16}{625}\\right)^{1/4}$. Use the principal real root.","promptAr":"أوجد قيمة $\\left(\\frac{16}{625}\\right)^{1/4}$ باستعمال الجذر الحقيقي الرئيس.","answer":"$\\left(\\frac{16}{625}\\right)^{1/4}=\\frac{2}{5}$ because $\\left(\\frac{2}{5}\\right)^{4}=\\frac{16}{625}$. The base is positive, so the principal root is positive.","answerAr":"$\\left(\\frac{16}{625}\\right)^{1/4}=\\frac{2}{5}$ لأن $\\left(\\frac{2}{5}\\right)^{4}=\\frac{16}{625}$. الأساس موجب، لذا نأخذ الجذر الرئيس الموجب.","options":["$\\frac{2}{5}$","$\\frac{1}{5}$","$\\frac{4}{25}$","$-\\frac{2}{5}$"],"optionsAr":["$\\frac{2}{5}$","$\\frac{1}{5}$","$\\frac{4}{25}$","$-\\frac{2}{5}$"],"sourcePage":599,"sourceQuestion":15,"rationalExponent":{"kind":"evaluate","base":0.0256,"p":1,"q":4,"choiceValues":[0.4,0.2,0.16,-0.4]},"correctIndex":0}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p599-q16',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p599-q16","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Evaluate and rewrite expressions involving rational exponents","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Evaluate $\\sqrt[6]{15625}$. Use the principal real root.","promptAr":"أوجد قيمة $\\sqrt[6]{15625}$ باستعمال الجذر الحقيقي الرئيس.","answer":"$\\sqrt[6]{15625}=5$ because $\\left(5\\right)^{6}=15625$. The base is positive, so the principal root is positive.","answerAr":"$\\sqrt[6]{15625}=5$ لأن $\\left(5\\right)^{6}=15625$. الأساس موجب، لذا نأخذ الجذر الرئيس الموجب.","options":["$125$","$5$","$-5$","$25$"],"optionsAr":["$125$","$5$","$-5$","$25$"],"sourcePage":599,"sourceQuestion":16,"rationalExponent":{"kind":"evaluate","base":15625,"p":1,"q":6,"choiceValues":[125,5,-5,25]},"correctIndex":1}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p599-designed-rewrite-1',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p599-designed-rewrite-1","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Evaluate and rewrite expressions involving rational exponents","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"For $x>0$, which radical expression is equivalent to $x^{3/4}$?","promptAr":"إذا كان $x>0$، فأي عبارة جذرية تكافئ $x^{3/4}$؟","answer":"$x^{3/4}=\\sqrt[4]{x^{3}}$. The denominator gives the root index and the numerator gives the power.","answerAr":"$x^{3/4}=\\sqrt[4]{x^{3}}$. المقام هو دليل الجذر، والبسط هو الأس.","options":["$x^{3}$","$\\sqrt[12]{x}$","$\\sqrt[4]{x^{3}}$","$\\sqrt[3]{x^{4}}$"],"optionsAr":["$x^{3}$","$\\sqrt[12]{x}$","$\\sqrt[4]{x^{3}}$","$\\sqrt[3]{x^{4}}$"],"sourceKind":"teacher-designed","sourceReference":"Supplementary rewriting practice aligned with page 599.","rationalExponent":{"kind":"rewrite","p":3,"q":4,"choiceValues":[3,0.08333333333333333,0.75,1.3333333333333333]},"correctIndex":2}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10g3-w10-p599-designed-rewrite-2',$question_json${"id":"10g3-w10-p599-designed-rewrite-2","classroom":"10G3","examWeek":10,"exam":"10G3 · 10th week practice","topic":"Evaluate and rewrite expressions involving rational exponents","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"For $x>0$, which radical expression is equivalent to $x^{5/3}$?","promptAr":"إذا كان $x>0$، فأي عبارة جذرية تكافئ $x^{5/3}$؟","answer":"$x^{5/3}=\\sqrt[3]{x^{5}}$. The denominator gives the root index and the numerator gives the power.","answerAr":"$x^{5/3}=\\sqrt[3]{x^{5}}$. المقام هو دليل الجذر، والبسط هو الأس.","options":["$\\sqrt[5]{x^{3}}$","$x^{5}$","$\\sqrt[15]{x}$","$\\sqrt[3]{x^{5}}$"],"optionsAr":["$\\sqrt[5]{x^{3}}$","$x^{5}$","$\\sqrt[15]{x}$","$\\sqrt[3]{x^{5}}$"],"sourceKind":"teacher-designed","sourceReference":"Supplementary rewriting practice aligned with page 599.","rationalExponent":{"kind":"rewrite","p":5,"q":3,"choiceValues":[0.6,5,0.06666666666666667,1.6666666666666667]},"correctIndex":3}$question_json$::jsonb)
